<title>UK: BayernHypo sets 200 mln guilder six-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BayernHypo sets 200 mln guilder six-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.86    PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.31     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.55	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT DSL DUE SEP.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
